      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Duke%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community reconciled in 1915 when the opposing parties buried a hatchet that was delivered in a horse-drawn hearse.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
